{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03433","headline":"襄阳作 · 崔湜","name":"襄阳作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庙堂初解印，郡邸忽腰章。\n按节巡河右，鸣驺入汉阳。\n城临南岘出，树绕北津长。\n好学风犹扇，夸才俗未忘。\n江山跨七泽，烟雨接三湘。\n蛟浦菱荷净，渔舟橘柚香。\n醉中求习氏，梦里忆襄王。\n宅坏仍思凤，碑存更忆羊。\n下车慙政美，闭阁幸时康。\n多谢南征术，于今尚不亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03433.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03433","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}